        {
          "text": "The registry record NCT03582137 (University of Colorado, Denver; cannabidiol for motor symptoms in PD) lists overall status COMPLETED with status verified date 2024-07, lists its phase as PHASE2 with 74 participants enrolled (type ACTUAL), and shows results first posted 2024-07-23. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-27)",
