        {
          "text": "The registry record NCT06629389 (sponsor Laboratorio Elea Phoenix; a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial of cannabidiol (Kanbis) in PD listing its phase as PHASE2, with primary outcome adverse events according to CTCAE v5.0) lists overall status RECRUITING with status verified date 2024-09, estimated primary completion 2025-11 and estimated enrollment 88, and shows no posted results. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-27)",
